  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="95c579cb-4be0-54b7-8bbf-fdaa8e6f146e" activityNameId="1f824b4d-7171-51a3-8819-52c785c75436" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, aircraft, passenger, long-haul, Infrastruktur</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, aircraft, passenger, long-haul, Infrastruktur
Inventory refers to the entire transport life cycle. Airport infrastructure expenditures and environmental interventions are accounted for using the yearly transport performance at uniqueairport in Zurich (73'526'350'051 pkm/a). Aircraft manufacturing is allocated based on the total life span of an aircraft (25'000 LTO), average distance of a flight (7850km) and its transport performance (251p/unit);
UUID: 8ddc8d90-0dd4-3cca-9464-3a17a800cb5c
The dataset describes the operation of aircrafts including taxying, take-off and landing covering fuel consumption and operation emissions. Aircraft manufacture and maintenance, airport construction, operation and dismantling are inputs to this dataset
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Aircraft operation modelled based on passenger aircrafts operated by Lufthansa Group in 2019. The emission profiles distinguish between LTO and cruise.
Time period: Start date refers to emission factor data. End date refers to year of reporting fuel consumption and transport activities
Production volume: 145'594'000'000pkm
Sampling: fuel consumption is based on corporate data, emission profiles are based on FOEN statistics 
Extrapolations: Allocation between passengers and freight based on weight (average passenger weight between 158kg and 163kg); allocation between booking classes based on seat area.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8ddc8d90-0dd4-3cca-9464-3a17a800cb5c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
